# Canonical www redirects are managed by the Cloudflare zone rule
# "UK Elections www to canonical HTTPS" (28 September 2026). It preserves
# paths and query strings for both HTTP and HTTPS. Pages host-source rules
# cannot implement that redirect.

# /accuracy/ is the URL a reader reaches for on a forecasting site, and it was
# a 404. The page already exists at /data-quality/, which is indexed, so this
# aliases rather than moves it: one accuracy page, no second copy to drift out
# of step with the first.
/accuracy /data-quality/ 301
/accuracy/ /data-quality/ 301

